/*!
@defgroup trdc_soc TRDC SOC Driver
@details The MCUXpresso SDK provides SoC-specific definitions for the Trusted
Resource Domain Controller (TRDC) driver on MCUXpresso SDK devices.

This component supplies device-level definitions used by the generic TRDC
driver, including:
  - The `trdc_master_t` enumeration mapping TRDC master IDs to their on-chip
    bus initiators (eDMA channels, CPU, debug masters, etc.)
  - The `TRDC_MBC_BLK()` packing macro and the `TRDC_MBC_GetTRDCInst() /
    GetMBCIdx() / GetSlvIdx() / GetBlkIdx()` accessor macros for addressing
    Memory Block Controller (MBC) entries
  - Driver-version macro

*/
